hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"246","[AI-translation] Hamein Ali bin Hujr ne hadith sunai. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sharik ne hadith sunai, Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samura se, kehne lagay: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath sau se zyada martaba majlis mein betha, aur un ke ashaab sha'er padhte the aur jahiliyat ke kuch maamlaat yaad karte the, aur Woh khamosh rehte the, aur kabhi kabhi un ke saath muskura bhi dete."
"247","[AI-translation] Hamein Ali bin Hujr ne hadith sunai. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sharik ne hadith sunai, 'Abd al-Malik bin 'Umayr se, Abi Salama se, Abi Hurayra se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, farmate hain: Arab ne jo sab se aftrak shair kaha hai woh Labid ka shair hai: Alaa kullu shay'in ma khala Allahu baatil (Suno! Allah ke siwa har cheez faani hai)."
"248","[AI-translation] Hamein Ahmad bin Mani' ne hadith sunai. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein Marwan bin Mu'awiya ne hadith sunai, 'Abdullah bin 'Abd ar-Rahman at-Ta'ifi se, 'Amr bin ash-Sharid se, apne waalid se, kehne lagay: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke peechhe sawar tha, phir maine unhe Umayya bin Abi as-Salt ath-Thaqafi ke sau qafiya (shair) sunaye. Jab bhi main unhe koi shair sunata, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mujhe farmate: Hiyh (aur bhi?), yahan tak ke maine unhe sau shair suna diye. Phir Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yaqeenan woh musalman hone ke qareeb tha."
"249","[AI-translation] Haddasana Isma'il bin Musa Al-Fazari wa 'Ali bin Hujr, aur ma'na ek hai, dono ne kaha: Haddasana 'Abdur Rahman bin Abi Az-Zinad, 'an Hisham bin 'Urwah, 'an apne waalid se, 'an 'Aishah, unhone farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hassan bin Saabit ke liye masjid mein ek minbar rakhte the, jis par woh khade hokar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se fakhar karte, ya kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se munafirat (dafaa) karte. Aur aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate: Allah Ta'ala Hassan ki madad ruh-e-qudus se karta hai, jab tak woh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se munafirat ya fakhar karta hai. Haddasana Isma'il bin Musa wa 'Ali bin Hujr, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Ibn Abi Az-Zinad, 'an apne waalid se, 'an 'Urwah, 'an 'Aishah, 'an Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), waisa hi."
"250","[AI-translation] Hamein Ismail bin Musa Al-Fazari aur Ali bin Hujr ne hadith sunayi, aur maana ek hai, dono ne kaha: Hamein Abdur Rahman bin Abi Az-Zinad ne hadith sunayi, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne waalid se, Aishah se. Unhone farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Hassan bin Thabit ke liye masjid mein ek minbar rakhte the, jin par wo khada hokar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki taraf se mufakhirat karta tha, ya farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki taraf se munafihat karta tha. Aur farmate the (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam): Beshak Allah Ta'ala Hassan ki madad Rooh-ul-Qudus se karte hain, jab tak wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki taraf se munafihat ya mufakhirat karta hai. Hamein Ismail bin Musa aur Ali bin Hujr ne hadith sunayi, dono ne kaha: Hamein Ibn-e-Abi Az-Zinad ne hadith sunayi, apne waalid se, Urwah se, Aishah se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, isi jaisi."
"251","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Hasan bin Sabbah Al-Bazzar, qala: haddasana Abu Al-Nadr, qala: haddasana Abu Aqil Al-Thaqafi Abdullah bin Aqil, an Mujalid, an Al-Sha'bi, an Masruq, an Aishah, qalat: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne ek raat apni biwiyon ko koi hadees sunaya. Un mein se ek aurat ne kaha: Yeh toh Khurafah ke hadees jaisa hai. Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho Khurafah kaun hai? Khurafah Udhrah ka ek aadmi tha, jise jahiliyat ke daur mein jinnon ne qaid kar liya. Woh un ke paas kaafi arsay raha. Phir unhone usay insaano ki taraf wapas kar diya. Phir woh logon ko un mein jo ajeeb-o-ghareeb baatein dekhi thi, sunata tha. Toh log kehne lage: Khurafah ka hadees."
